{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leave no reward behind when you complete this season's Battle Pass and Legacy Pass. Warriors from all Factions have armed themselves with the Y9S1 Battle Bundle. It gives you access to 100 tiers of progression rewards for both Battle Pass and Legacy Pass for all 36 heroes, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Instant unlock of the next 25 tiers in your current progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-2 Executions, Weapon Sets, and Paired Emotes (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-4 Battle Outfits and Effects (per hero)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Various customization elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-A 20% bonus in battle points earned through completed matches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Legacy Pass tier #101 for retrofitted rewards for all heroes released after Y5S1 to date</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-And more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The For Honor Y9S1 Battle Bundle is available until June 10, 2025, and is not eligible for refund.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534400?t=1741882606","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3534400?t=1741882606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534400/2f1a5be9ba880d95dd1df314d3278276a77699a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741882606","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534400/2f1a5be9ba880d95dd1df314d3278276a77699a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741882606","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Part